<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">hemorrhagic-burst</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Hemorrhagic Burst</ansi> spell ruptures blood vessels outward in a
devastating explosion, dealing grievous damage to every enemy in the
room. The force of the rupture bypasses most mundane armor, making it
fearsome against heavily protected foes.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast hemorrhagic-burst</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Area
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Elemental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 16
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 80
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — armor and constitution resist the rupture
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Heavy damage to all enemies in the room

